title: TownSquareIntro
---
<<declare $bakerName = "Dalila">>
<<declare $officerName= "Branko">>
<<declare $collegeFriendName= "Katarina">>

<<zeroChar>>
{$protagName}: (<i>Well, looks like I have the rest of the afternoon to myself.</i>)
{$protagName}: (<i>I should grab something to eat.</i>)

//go to outside of bakery
<<changeBG 1>>

{$protagName} walks into {$bakerName}'s Bakery

//go in to bakery
<<changeBG 2>>

//Put Dalila in the person 2 slot (it lines up better with the layout of the bakery)
<<twoChar>>
<<changeSprite 1 0>>
<<changeSprite 2 0>>

<<lighten 2>>
{$bakerName}: Hey, {$protagName}! You look sharp today.
{$bakerName}: I saw your parents the other day. They mentioned that you're starting a new job?
<<darken 2>>

{$protagName}: I am. Today was my first shift at the new museum, so I figured that I'd look presentable, despite how my morning went.

{$protagName} shows {$bakerName} the bandage on his hand.

<<lighten 2>>
{$bakerName}: Oh my! Let me guess, it was Art, wasn't it?
<<darken 2>>

{$protagName}: Yeah, he tried to make me breakfast. You know how he is, left the kettle on.

<<lighten 2>>
{$bakerName}: Well, I can at least give you a doughnut for your troubles.
{$bakerName}: Don't worry, it's on the house!
<<darken 2>>

{$bakerName} grabs a doughnut from the display case and hands it to {$protagName}.  

{$protagName}: Really? Thanks a lot!

<<lighten 2>>
{$bakerName}: You're welcome!
<<darken 2>>

{$protagName}: Anyways, I should be going now. It was nice talking to you, {$bakerName}!

<<lighten 2>>
{$bakerName}: Make sure you get home safe and tell your parents I said hi!
<<darken 2>>

{$protagName}: Don’t worry, I will!

<<zeroChar>>
<<changeBG 0>>

{$protagName} walks out of the bakery and starts heading home.
While enjoying his doughnut, he sees a crowd of people gathered.
The crowd consists of two school sports teams, and they begin to argue and push each other around.

//Display Branko
<<oneChar>>
<<changeSprite 1 1>>
Officer {$officerName} waves to {$protagName} and walks over to him.

<<lighten 1>>
{$officerName}: Hey, {$protagName}! How was your first day at the museum?
<<darken 1>>
-> Pretty interesting, but I don't think {$directorName} likes me much.
    {$protagName}: Pretty interesting, but I don't think {$directorName} likes me much.
-> It wasn't bad, and I had some interesting conversations.
    {$protagName}: It wasn't bad, and I had some interesting conversations.
    {$protagName}: You know {$directorName}, right?

<<lighten 1>>
{$officerName}: I can't say I know {$directorName} well, but he always seemed grumpy.
<<darken 1>>

{$protagName}: I can see why you'd think that.

The crowd of people is getting louder, and shoving has turned into throwing punches.

<<lighten 1>>
{$officerName}: Sorry, {$protagName}, I have to take care of this.
<<darken 1>>

<<zeroChar>>
Before {$protagName} could respond, {$officerName} runs off to stop the fight.
{$protagName} watches {$officerName} try to scare off the students, before deciding it was best to head home.

//Display Katarina
<<oneChar>>
<<changeSprite 1 2>>
While he hurriedly walks away, he spots {$collegeFriendName}.

{$protagName}: (<i>I wonder what she's doing here?</i>)
{$protagName}: (<i>It'd be best to check on her before she gets too distracted by the commotion.</i>)

The crowd of people seems to be quieting slightly - someone is probably being detained.

{$protagName}: Hey, Katarina!
-> Are you alright?
    {$protagName}: Are you alright?
    <<jump TownSquareKatarina1>>
-> What are you doing here?
    {$protagName}: What are you doing here?
    <<jump TownSquareKatarina2>>
===

title: TownSquareKatarina1
---
<<lighten 1>>
{$collegeFriendName}: I'm fine. How about you?
<<darken 1>>
-> I'm safe, at least.
    {$protagName}: I'm safe, at least.
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$collegeFriendName}: That's good. I was expecting this sort of stuff with the election coming up, but it's still unpredictable.
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: It's the first one in thirty years, so that makes sense.
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$collegeFriendName}: It’s the party that wants peace versus a paramilitary group.
    <<darken 1>>
    -> Isn't calling them paramilitary a bit harsh?
        {$protagName}: Isn't calling them paramilitary a bit harsh?
        <<lighten 1>>
        {$collegeFriendName}: Not when they advocate for forceful segregation.
        <<darken 1>>
    -> Yikes. When you put it like that, I get why people are so angry.
        {$protagName}: Yikes. When you put it like that, I get why people are so angry.
    <<wait 1>>
    <<jump TownSquareKatarinaEnd>>
-> I'm a bit spooked.
    {$protagName}: I'm a bit spooked.
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$collegeFriendName}: Me too. Just because this sort of thing isn’t rare doesn’t mean it’s pleasant. Don’t worry, though, I’ll protect you.
    <<darken 1>>
    -> My hero.
        {$protagName}: My hero.
        {$collegeFriendName} smirks.
    -> Thanks. I still wish people didn’t get into fights so often.
        {$protagName}: Thanks. I still wish people didn’t get into fights so often.
        {$collegeFriendName} frowns.
        <<lighten 1>>
        {$collegeFriendName}: Same here.
        <<darken 1>>
    <<jump TownSquareKatarinaEnd>>
===

title: TownSquareKatarina2
---
<<lighten 1>>
{$collegeFriendName}: I was just heading home. I know sports fans could get unruly, but I’ve never seen it in person before.
<<darken 1>>
{$protagName}: I think it’s weird that people get so into sports… It’s literally just watching people kick around a ball.
<<lighten 1>>
{$collegeFriendName}: It’s never just sports. There’s always politics involved, especially here.
<<darken 1>>
{$protagName}: Yeah, I guess you would know, Ms. Star Student.
{$collegeFriendName} chuckles.
<<lighten 1>>
{$collegeFriendName}: We actually talked about this in my class with Professor…sorry about that.
<<darken 1>>
{$protagName}: You can talk about college; I’m going eventually. Hopefully.
<<lighten 1>>
{$collegeFriendName}: I know you’ll get there.
<<darken 1>>
-> I just need to save up for a car
    {$protagName}: I just need to save up for a car
-> My parents are just really worried about the election and all
    {$protagName}: My parents are just really worried about the election and all
<<lighten 1>>
{$collegeFriendName}: It'll work out.
<<darken 1>>
<<jump TownSquareKatarinaEnd>>
===

title: TownSquareKatarinaEnd
---
{$collegeFriendName}: Well, I can't miss the bus. Maybe i'll see you later?
-> Sure.
    {$protagName}: Sure.
-> Hopefully.
    {$protagName}: Hopefully.
<<zeroChar>>
{$collegeFriendName} waves goodbye and exits the square.
{$protagName} is finally able to go home.
===
